    narr:narration """The architecture hub centers on a [decisive migration](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_1) from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, a move framed by Dave as a settled path for the analytics pipeline. This transition is supported by [rationales regarding efficiency](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_2) and [quantified performance expectations](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_4). The session has formalized these points into [explicit summary commitments](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_3) regarding the database choice and a [targeted Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1784195435927_5). These specific actions align with a [broader organizational shift](narr:Narrative_DataPlatformModernizationForPerformanceAndCost) toward modernizing data infrastructure to prioritize both cost reduction and high-performance throughput.""" ;
